# REST API

### Get All Profiles
### curl http://localhost:3000/profile
GET http://localhost:3000/profile

### Create New Profile
### curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/profile
POST http://localhost:3000/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "demo1",
    "password": "$2b$13$NzJFHtFgFs0HGnrbyTdzweg6F./vTYN3SV4HEEJWkxNqqDwIJaYu6",
    "mobile": "0ff89de99d4a8f4b04cb162bcb5740cf",
    "cardId": "1d147181391a78468caa30a67b848861"
}

### Get some profile by id
GET http://localhost:3000/profile/18063f67-2929-4191-b1fa-03030e0d588e

